Commit-Queue: Hiroki Nakagawa <nhiroki@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1721579}
Electron adaptation notes (43-x-y):
execution_context.{h,cc}: this branch keeps its is_draining_pending_exceptions_
guard; pending_exceptions_ becomes the upstream pair vector and the drain
loop passes the stored SanitizeScriptErrors to ExceptionThrown().
shared_worker_global_scope.{h,cc}: the branch's extra classic-script
fetch methods are kept; only ExceptionThrown() gains the parameter.
shared_worker_reporting_proxy.cc: worker_ is a raw pointer here
(CrossThreadUnretained(worker_) instead of worker_.get()).
runtime_enabled_features.json5: only SanitizeWorkerErrorPropagation added.
dedicated_worker_test.cc is not carried (the test file has drifted too far
from this branch; Electron does not build blink unit tests).

